---
layout: base.njk
title: Our makers
navKey: Our makers
description: Meet the two independent makers behind Sticks & Giggles.
permalink: /makers/index.html
---
<header class="page-hero page-hero--split">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our makers</p>
    <h1>Meet the people behind<br />Sticks &amp; Giggles.</h1>
    <p>Sticks &amp; Giggles is the name we use when Bits and Bobyns and The Yorkshire Garage attend markets together.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="makers-detail section">
  <div class="shell">
    {% for brand in site.brands %}
      <article class="maker-profile maker-profile--{{ brand.panelTone }}" id="{{ brand.name | slugify }}">
        <div class="maker-profile-image">
          <img src="{{ brand.image }}" alt="{{ brand.name }} handmade work" />
        </div>
        <div class="maker-profile-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ brand.kicker }}</p>
          <h2>{{ brand.name }}</h2>
          <p>{{ brand.description }}</p>
          {% if brand.tone == "sewn" %}
            <p>Robyn works with colourful fabrics and embroidery. Her range includes useful things for the home as well as small characters and seasonal decorations.</p>
          {% else %}
            <p>Aiden works with the grain and shape of each piece of timber. Knots and natural variation stay visible in the finished work.</p>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="button {% if brand.panelTone == 'dark' %}button--pink{% else %}button--dark{% endif %}" href="{{ brand.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ brand.buttonLabel }}</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-band">
  <div class="shell contact-band-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our shared stall</p>
      <h2>See the two ranges together.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="button button--dark" href="/gallery/">Explore the gallery</a>
  </div>
</section>
